<title>HONG KONG: Dah Sing unit places HK$200 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Dah Sing unit places HK$200 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dah Sing Bank Ltd, a unit of Dah Sing Financial Holdings Ltd, has privately placed the following floating rate certificate of deposit issue, said arranger DKB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER    DAH SING BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT	HK$200 MLN COUPON     3MH+25BP  MATURITY 05.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY FREQ  QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING	--	   SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  FREE&amp;CLR</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   HONG KONG  GOV LAW    HONG KONG PAY DATE 05.MAY.97</p>
<p> ARRANGER    DKB ASIA</p>
<p> PAY AGENT   HONGKONG AND SHANGHAI BANKING CORP</p>
<p> NOTES	 PROCEEDS FOR GENERAL FUNDING REQUIREMENTS.</p>
<p>		 CLEARING THROUGH CMU.</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF DAH SING BANK'S HK$3.0 BLN CD PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
